WEBVTT

00:01:53.070 --> 00:02:00.000
Previously on Dragon Ball Z, Vegeta made an explosive return to the tournament arena.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.500
his heart reawakened by Babidi's magic the Saiyan Prince had become a servant

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:10.970
to the forces of evil Babidi transport us to a place away from these people if

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:15.920
you give me that then I will fight Vegeta Babidi willingly granted Goku's

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:21.800
request and zapped the Z fighters from the stadium floor now miles from

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:26.390
